@host = http://localhost:5266

### Registrar usuário

POST {{host}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

### Login

POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Registrar B
POST http://localhost:5266/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "João", "email": "joao@teste.com", "senha": "senha1234" }

### Login B
POST http://localhost:5266/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "joao@teste.com", "senha": "senha1234" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token2", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar casamento
POST http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeNoivo1": "Maria",
  "nomeNoivo2": "João",
  "dataPrevista": "2027-06-12",
  "cidade": "Blumenau",
  "orcamentoTotal": 60000
}

### Ver casamento
GET http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar casamento
PUT http://localhost:5266/api/casamento/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeNoivo1": "Maria",
  "nomeNoivo2": "João",
  "dataPrevista": "2027-06-12",
  "cidade": "Blumenau",
  "orcamentoTotal": 60000
}

### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:5266/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:5266/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Lua de mel" }

### Editar categoria
PUT http://localhost:5266/api/categorias/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Buffet e bebidas" }

### Excluir categoria
DELETE http://localhost:5266/api/categorias/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar despesa à vista
POST http://localhost:5266/api/despesas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Buffet - entrada",
  "valorTotal": 12000,
  "categoriaId": 3,
  "status": "APagar"
}

### Listar (com filtros opcionais)
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas?categoriaId=1&status=APagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar despesa
PUT http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "descricao": "Buffet - entrada",
  "valorTotal": 5000,
  "categoriaId": 4,
  "status": "APagar"
}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Parcelar em 3x
POST http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/10/parcelas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantidade": 3,
  "primeiroVencimento": "2027-01-31"
}

### Ver parcelas
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/10/parcelas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver a despesa
GET http://localhost:5266/api/despesas/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagar parcela (data de hoje)
POST http://localhost:5266/api/parcelas/13/pagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagar parcela com data
POST http://localhost:5266/api/parcelas/30/pagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dataPagamento": "2027-10-30" }

### Situação do plano
GET http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assinar
POST http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura/assinar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar
POST http://localhost:5266/api/assinatura/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo do dashboard
GET http://localhost:5266/api/dashboard/resumo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar compromisso (sem fuso: considera Brasília)
POST http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "F",
  "tipo": "F",
  "dataHora": "2026-11-02T15:00:00",
  "local": "Ateliê da Ana",
  "status": "Concluido",
  "antecedenciaLembreteDias": "30"
}

### Compromisso já passado (atraso)
POST http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Degustação do buffet",
  "tipo": "Degustação",
  "dataHora": "2026-10-20T14:00:00Z",
  "status": "Concluido"
}

### Listar compromissos (opcionalmente ?status=Pendente)
GET http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos?status=Pendente
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar compromisso por Id
GET http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir compromisso
DELETE http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lembretes
GET http://localhost:5266/api/compromissos/lembretes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}